WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.120 --> 01:32.290
Aah, I haven't been collecting any hearts lately.

01:32.290 --> 01:33.690
How about you, Vanilla?

01:33.690 --> 01:34.960
Today, well...

01:34.960 --> 01:36.460
Ah! Enough!

01:37.590 --> 01:39.790
So many that you have to count?

01:50.440 --> 01:54.240
Chocolat-chan, surely you couldn't be thinking
of taking the hearts of those little tykes?

01:54.240 --> 01:56.840
Yep. No matter how little,
a heart is a heart.

02:01.880 --> 02:04.750
Hey you. What're you looking
at Vanilla like that for?!

02:04.750 --> 02:07.690
You're too young to be thinking
like that, you little squirt!

02:09.730 --> 02:11.230
Hmph! I'll whup your butt!

02:12.090 --> 02:13.430
Chocolat-chan...

02:15.900 --> 02:17.470
S-sorry. My bad.

02:17.470 --> 02:21.170
Man, it seems that lately I've hit a total slump.

02:22.000 --> 02:22.660
Huh?

02:26.940 --> 02:28.410
It's headed straight at me!

02:35.780 --> 02:38.390
Ow...that hurt!

02:38.820 --> 02:40.090
Chocolat-chan, that's...

02:41.860 --> 02:43.690
A letter from the Magic World, isn't it?

02:44.090 --> 02:46.330
Can't they find a more normal way to deliver those?

02:47.830 --> 02:49.930
What's wrong? Who's the letter from?

02:51.070 --> 02:53.640
Gramps's coming to the human world.

02:53.640 --> 02:55.370
Grandpa Corne?!

02:56.940 --> 02:59.970
Gramps Invades! Love Dance Showdown!

03:01.380 --> 03:02.710
Aw, man!

03:03.380 --> 03:05.750
First my heart-collecting is at an
all-time low,

03:05.750 --> 03:09.720
and now Gramps decides to come visit?! This sucks!

03:10.120 --> 03:13.170
But why on earth would your grandfather
be coming here?

03:13.760 --> 03:15.660
Chocolat's heart collecting
is going so poorly,

03:15.660 --> 03:18.790
you don't even have to
consider her a rival anymore!

03:18.790 --> 03:21.660
I bet he's coming here to take her back
to the Magic World in defeat!

03:22.330 --> 03:23.730
You think so, too?

03:24.400 --> 03:26.600
You are frightfully honest.

03:28.070 --> 03:29.470
What are you doing?!

03:30.470 --> 03:31.940
But what am I going to do?

03:32.310 --> 03:35.980
Vanilla, I don't want him to take me back!

03:35.980 --> 03:37.780
It's okay, Chocolat-chan.

03:38.980 --> 03:40.450
That Gramps of mine would do it!

03:40.980 --> 03:43.050
Even with his own grandchild, he's relentless!

03:44.390 --> 03:47.850
Ah-ha! I gotta have Robin convince
him to keep me here!

03:50.590 --> 03:51.560
Robin!

03:51.560 --> 03:56.430
Sorry! I've got an additional concert all of a sudden.

03:57.970 --> 04:00.970
Th-there are lots of cute babes waiting for me.

04:00.970 --> 04:04.170
That's a lie! You're really just scared of my grandpa!

04:04.170 --> 04:05.040
You can't run away!

04:06.270 --> 04:07.040
Ow!

04:08.340 --> 04:09.110
See ya!

04:11.350 --> 04:14.550
If my familiar can't help me now, he's worthless.

04:15.050 --> 04:18.220
Duke! You gotta give it your all! Help me here!

04:18.220 --> 04:20.050
Alas, I must depart on a long journey...

04:21.060 --> 04:23.420
...pondering what it is to have the life of a frog.

04:23.420 --> 04:24.790
Whaaat?!

04:25.190 --> 04:27.090
Good luck with your grandpa!

04:28.430 --> 04:32.100
Is this grandfather of hers so tough that
he drives everyone away like this?

04:33.570 --> 04:34.700
I wonder...

04:36.840 --> 04:39.800
If that's how it's going to be, I'm hiding too!

04:40.210 --> 04:40.470
Later!

04:40.880 --> 04:41.480
Eh?!

04:46.250 --> 04:47.980
Bring it on!

04:47.980 --> 04:49.450
Chocolat-chan!

04:49.450 --> 04:50.950
It's too late!

04:59.730 --> 05:01.250
Been waiting long?

05:01.250 --> 05:02.100
Quick!

05:02.730 --> 05:05.700
I sent a letter by owl in advance. Did you get it?

05:06.200 --> 05:07.030
Y...yeah.

05:09.440 --> 05:14.590
What a messy room...
I can't live here like this.

05:14.880 --> 05:16.510
Eh? What do you mean, "live here"?

05:16.840 --> 05:19.710
Is it okay if I improve it a bit?

05:19.710 --> 05:22.880
That guys not listening!

05:22.880 --> 05:24.090
What do you mean, "that guy"?!

05:24.590 --> 05:27.950
That's not how you address your elders!

05:31.790 --> 05:34.560
Such manners must run in the family.

05:34.930 --> 05:39.070
Agrandissment! Rune sage!

05:39.070 --> 05:41.570
Change into a room that is appropriate!

05:47.240 --> 05:50.740
Ah...so relaxing.

05:51.110 --> 05:52.350
How cute!

05:52.780 --> 05:54.820
What the heck did you do to my room?!

05:54.820 --> 05:56.620
This ain't my style at all!

05:56.620 --> 05:58.250
Hurry up and change it back!

05:58.720 --> 06:02.360
This house is so inhospitable!
Not even a welcoming meal!

06:02.360 --> 06:06.690
I see, I see! You long for your
grandpas home cooking?

06:06.690 --> 06:08.970
All right! Consider it done.

06:09.400 --> 06:11.500
Stop! Cut it out already!

06:11.900 --> 06:15.500
Agrandissment! Rune sage!

06:16.270 --> 06:19.510
Come out, lots of tasty dishes!

06:21.580 --> 06:25.980
Boilin', cookiri', stewin'!

06:25.980 --> 06:27.620
Okay! I'll leave the rest to you.

06:27.620 --> 06:29.080
Gramps, where're you going?

06:29.450 --> 06:31.490
Taking a bath.

06:35.590 --> 06:38.090
When did all this get here?!

06:38.090 --> 06:39.930
Why'd you follow me?

06:41.700 --> 06:45.170
Do you want to join your lonely grandpa for a bath?

06:45.970 --> 06:47.000
I'll whup your butt!

06:49.740 --> 06:52.640
Just what the heck is Gramps thinking?

06:52.940 --> 06:55.580
He's not thinking at all, is what he's thinking.

06:55.580 --> 06:59.640
Just like Chocolat, he's a fool who doesn't
listen to others' common sense.

07:01.520 --> 07:03.520
What the?!

07:03.520 --> 07:06.490
It appears he can hear whenever we
say something bad about him!

07:10.060 --> 07:11.460
Yummy!

07:11.890 --> 07:14.660
A hot bath followed by a parfait is fantastic!

07:15.300 --> 07:20.130
Strange. How did those ingredients
turn into a parfait?

07:20.130 --> 07:21.440
But it's tasty!

07:21.440 --> 07:25.170
Gramps, why're you always
gettin' in the way of things?

07:25.870 --> 07:28.680
I'm trying to diet so I can win more hearts, but...

07:29.180 --> 07:30.340
Hey, what's your problem?

07:30.810 --> 07:31.780
Aren't you going to have any?

07:32.310 --> 07:35.050
Parfaits are for kids, I am so past that.

07:35.450 --> 07:37.640
Chocolat-chan, you shouldn't try too hard.

07:39.690 --> 07:44.290
It's even less healthy to deny yourself
the things you want to eat.

07:44.760 --> 07:45.830
Now. Eat.

07:50.530 --> 07:51.820
Yummy!

07:53.600 --> 07:54.840
Of course!

07:55.200 --> 07:57.330
Your cooking brings back memories...

07:58.540 --> 08:01.370
I can't be doing this. It's no good
if I get caught up in his flow.

08:02.110 --> 08:06.750
I'm busy with heart-collecting training,
ok? Stop bothering me!

08:07.380 --> 08:09.340
Got sooo many things to do!

08:09.620 --> 08:10.250
Yo!

08:10.850 --> 08:11.350
Hey!

08:11.920 --> 08:13.920
Hey, you guys are late!

08:13.920 --> 08:17.290
Yeah, right! We flew here right
after we got your letter!

08:17.860 --> 08:18.960
He isn't listening to me at all....

08:19.990 --> 08:23.530
We brought you your favorite treat from
the human world, mustard mentaiko.

08:24.070 --> 08:26.360
Ooh, I can always count on you, Houx!

08:26.670 --> 08:28.740
So thoughtful.

08:31.510 --> 08:37.370
The prickly spiciness and the squishy
texture of the roe is irresistible!

08:37.610 --> 08:41.720
I can't believe it. Eating parfait,
then mustard mentaiko?

08:42.080 --> 08:44.380
He has no sense of delicacy!

08:44.790 --> 08:47.790
Okay, now that I am full...

08:47.790 --> 08:49.690
Want to go for a drive?

08:49.690 --> 08:50.460
Eh?!

08:50.990 --> 08:52.090
Now you're talkin'!

08:52.830 --> 08:53.760
But where's the car?

08:57.130 --> 08:59.870
What's wrong? Hurry up and hop in, you two!

09:00.400 --> 09:03.000
But, I might get car-sick...

09:03.440 --> 09:04.740
That's right!

09:04.740 --> 09:09.910
Vanilla-chama does not go for drives with a bunch
of unclassy hooligans like chyyyYYYOUUUU!!!

09:12.550 --> 09:15.850
I gotta go train for heart-collecting!

09:15.850 --> 09:17.950
You can do that later!

09:17.950 --> 09:21.190
This here sky-drive's TAKIN' OFF!

09:25.360 --> 09:27.630
YAHOO!

09:37.440 --> 09:43.080
I'm gonna step on it, guys! Hold on tight!

09:55.090 --> 09:56.020
Pretty.

09:57.460 --> 10:01.330
The clouds against the setting sun make
the sky look like a salmon-pink ocean.

10:07.440 --> 10:08.400
Let's go, Chocolat!

10:13.910 --> 10:15.610
Me too! Oof!

11:13.630 --> 11:15.440
Eh? We're still going?!

11:15.440 --> 11:20.040
Of course! The night's still young!

11:48.340 --> 11:50.890
Chocolat-chan! Houx, Saule! Wake up!

11:52.840 --> 11:56.510
Vanilla-chama! Just leave them be!

11:56.510 --> 11:57.940
I can't do that!

11:58.310 --> 12:00.510
It can't be helped, can it?

12:01.620 --> 12:06.450
WAKE UP! VANILLA-CHAMA
WILL BE LATE FOR SCHOOL!

12:06.950 --> 12:08.050
School...?

12:08.720 --> 12:10.370
Can't we skip?

12:11.760 --> 12:12.930
Chocolat-chan!

12:13.360 --> 12:16.330
Hurry up or you'll be late for school!

12:18.470 --> 12:19.880
S'no use.

12:20.470 --> 12:23.640
Gramps has totally taken over.

12:29.880 --> 12:32.580
My complexion's gross, my hairs a mess...

12:32.980 --> 12:35.880
No was will I take any hearts at this rate.

12:35.880 --> 12:37.120
It'll be okay!

12:37.590 --> 12:39.120
We'll just slick it down...

12:40.450 --> 12:41.120
See?

12:43.920 --> 12:44.990
It's fine! It's fine!

12:44.990 --> 12:50.160
Tonight add a drop of rose and lavender extract
into your bathtub, and take along soak.

12:50.600 --> 12:52.630
That new bathroom...

12:53.700 --> 12:56.840
Yo! Wanna join me?

12:57.510 --> 12:59.140
Over my dead body!

13:00.270 --> 13:01.840
It's all Gramps's fault!

13:04.850 --> 13:13.150
And so! After the grueling battle, I emerged from
the whale's belly with the HOTTEST BABE EVER!!!

13:15.860 --> 13:19.660
Though I should probably keep mum about
what happened between the two of us...

13:21.430 --> 13:22.580
Gramps...

13:23.060 --> 13:25.930
Hey, hey! Your grandpa is so funny!

13:26.270 --> 13:28.870
He's great at making up stories!

13:28.870 --> 13:30.440
Whattaya talkin' about?!

13:30.440 --> 13:33.080
It is a TRUE! LIFE! STORY!

13:33.440 --> 13:35.180
CUT IT OUT, GRAMPS!

13:35.180 --> 13:36.940
Hurry up and GO HOME!

13:36.940 --> 13:38.140
What's your problem?

13:38.850 --> 13:44.090
Isn't it common sense to meet all your classmates?

13:44.090 --> 13:45.390
Awesome!

13:45.390 --> 13:48.590
Kato has such an awesome grandpa! So powerful!

13:49.090 --> 13:53.730
So Chocolat, how's about we
all hang together after class?

13:53.730 --> 13:54.490
Forget it!

13:54.830 --> 13:57.970
I've outgrown you since I got here, y'know!

13:57.970 --> 14:00.830
I don't need ya baby-sittin' me
everyday like you used to!

14:04.670 --> 14:06.310
Did I take it too far?

14:07.610 --> 14:09.080
Gramps! Waiting long?

14:09.080 --> 14:10.840
Been waiting FOREVER!

14:20.960 --> 14:24.360
No matter what we say, he just won't listen.

14:24.360 --> 14:26.490
Chocolat-chan's in trouble.

14:34.570 --> 14:39.970
Gramps, enough already. No more.
My body can't take anymore.

14:39.970 --> 14:42.710
Well then, why don't we have a match?

14:44.210 --> 14:47.610
Whoever can pick up the most hearts.

14:48.150 --> 14:51.370
If you win, I will consider leaving.

14:51.690 --> 14:52.420
For real?

14:52.790 --> 14:55.420
But. If you lose...

14:55.760 --> 14:56.660
If I lose?

14:57.120 --> 15:00.030
Your comfy bed is all mine!

15:00.030 --> 15:01.900
What's that supposed to mean?

15:02.230 --> 15:05.880
I'm saying I will move in for good.

15:06.370 --> 15:08.500
Gramps—you gotta be kiddin' me!

15:08.940 --> 15:12.410
Alrighty! Better get some shut-eye
before tomorrows match.

15:13.840 --> 15:16.140
You're gonna use my bed again?!

15:20.680 --> 15:22.750
I ain't gonna lose this one! No way!

15:42.300 --> 15:44.340
Is it really okay, Chocolat-chan?

15:44.670 --> 15:49.800
Of course it's okay! At this rate, Gramps is
totally blowin' my chance at being Queen!

15:50.110 --> 15:55.760
If you lose to me, you might as well give
up that being-Queen business.

16:00.150 --> 16:03.660
So! Everyone! Are you ready?

16:03.660 --> 16:08.230
At long last, it's the Boogie-Woogie Dance
Showdown! Let's get this party started!

16:10.130 --> 16:18.330
Anyone's welcome to dance! Just jump in at
any time! Let's boogie down tonight! Yeah!

16:18.330 --> 16:20.790
Let's...DANCE!

16:25.150 --> 16:30.680
This is perfect. I will pick up everyone's
hearts with my dancin' skills!

16:32.890 --> 16:36.360
Miss, shall you give me the pleasure of this dance?

16:36.860 --> 16:37.560
Sure.

16:39.230 --> 16:40.790
Agrandissment!

16:40.790 --> 16:42.630
Rune sage!

16:49.640 --> 16:51.870
So, shall we?

17:02.720 --> 17:05.150
Nice one, baby!

17:05.590 --> 17:08.350
Wow, such a passionate man...

17:10.160 --> 17:12.100
Ah! Her heart appeared!

17:12.630 --> 17:14.330
Agrandissment!

17:14.330 --> 17:17.000
Rune sage!

17:17.000 --> 17:21.130
Heart! Oh, heart! Come to me!

17:25.570 --> 17:30.780
Amazing! Grandpa Corne picked
up a heart in the blink of an eye!

17:30.780 --> 17:33.650
That trouble-maker is really something!

17:36.750 --> 17:39.620
This game is mine!

17:41.390 --> 17:44.720
I can't lose to that old goat!

17:52.600 --> 17:56.200
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:03.740 --> 18:05.340
What is this, all of a sudden?!

18:08.650 --> 18:12.220
Watching from the side is so boring, you guys!

18:12.220 --> 18:14.190
Have a little fun, will ya?!

18:14.560 --> 18:17.590
But I suck at dancing.

18:17.590 --> 18:20.030
This is embarrassing. Cut it out already, Kato!

18:22.430 --> 18:24.700
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:25.130 --> 18:27.630
I'm getting into the groove now!

18:28.400 --> 18:29.640
Me too!

18:30.700 --> 18:32.840
Chocolat-chan! Orange hearts!

18:33.740 --> 18:36.440
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:37.710 --> 18:39.510
Your hearts...

18:39.510 --> 18:41.050
Pick up!

18:42.480 --> 18:44.750
Great! Chocolat's in the lead!

18:45.150 --> 18:47.550
Huh? What was I doing just now?

18:47.890 --> 18:51.060
It feels like I broke a major sweat!

18:51.560 --> 18:53.130
Thanks, you guys!

18:53.560 --> 18:56.130
Me too-I dunno why, but—WHOO!

19:05.270 --> 19:07.010
So many hearts are popping up!

19:07.980 --> 19:09.880
Agrandissment!

19:09.880 --> 19:11.740
Rune sage!

19:12.180 --> 19:15.580
Hearts! Oh, hearts! Come to me!

19:17.180 --> 19:20.690
Wow! What will you do now, Chocolat-chan?

19:21.320 --> 19:23.520
This ain't over yet!

19:40.170 --> 19:42.480
I haven't even broken a sweat!

19:49.480 --> 19:51.680
Let's dance!

19:52.050 --> 19:53.170
Dance!

19:53.450 --> 19:54.370
Dance!

19:54.760 --> 19:57.960
I'm losin' control! I just gotta dance!

19:58.330 --> 20:01.160
MAN! This is freakin' FUN!

20:10.040 --> 20:10.740
Wow.

20:11.070 --> 20:12.570
He's overwhelming.

20:13.210 --> 20:16.280
Gramps, what the hell...how can
you be so full of energy?

20:16.280 --> 20:17.780
I can't take anymore!

20:30.590 --> 20:33.160
So! The next challenger is...!

20:36.200 --> 20:37.830
Man, I was creamed.

20:38.770 --> 20:40.670
You got quite a stash!

20:40.970 --> 20:43.040
No way I would have lost.

20:43.470 --> 20:47.710
But Chocolat, you also picked up quite a few hearts.

20:48.940 --> 20:50.480
He's right, Chocolat-chan.

20:51.480 --> 20:52.310
Good job!

20:54.210 --> 20:59.420
If you just lighten up and relax, things'll get better.

21:01.050 --> 21:02.150
You're tellin' me...

21:02.690 --> 21:05.930
That was the entire point with this match?

21:07.460 --> 21:08.430
Indeed.

21:11.700 --> 21:12.430
Gramps...

21:17.870 --> 21:20.040
Hi, Corne-chan!

21:23.680 --> 21:26.010
Thanks. For. Wai-ting! *smooch!*

21:26.850 --> 21:30.050
Gracious! Sorry for holding you up!

21:31.720 --> 21:32.520
Whozzat?!

21:33.090 --> 21:34.020
Not there!

21:34.450 --> 21:39.520
This is my new girlfriend. We're going on a roadtrip.

21:39.890 --> 21:42.280
And now I'm loaded with ecures!

21:42.800 --> 21:46.630
We're gonna have a gorgeous
around-outer-space cruise!

21:50.670 --> 21:52.770
So long, Chocolat!

22:02.450 --> 22:04.820
Was this whole match really for my sake?

22:23.190 --> 22:29.470
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.600 --> 22:30.970
"Love"

22:31.910 --> 22:35.410
A magic spell.

22:37.580 --> 22:44.850
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.280 --> 22:54.360
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:56.030 --> 23:00.300
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.900 --> 23:03.970
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.270 --> 23:11.340
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.710 --> 23:16.150
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.150 --> 23:26.260
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.320 --> 23:35.170
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.980 --> 23:48.890
Halloween looks like a lotta fun!

23:48.890 --> 23:52.390
Everyone in the human world throws parties just like the ones in the Magic World!

23:52.390 --> 23:53.920
Leave it to me, guys!

23:53.920 --> 23:57.230
As a member of the executive committee, I'm all fired up for Halloween!

23:57.770 --> 24:01.690
Eh? The executive committee is made up of Pierre's horde of fangirls?!

24:03.090 --> 24:04.540
That SUCKS!

24:05.710 --> 24:07.800
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.800 --> 24:10.360
Super Scary! Halloween Test of Courage.

24:10.850 --> 24:12.930
You better watch, or I'll whup your butt!

24:12.930 --> 24:13.750
Thanks!
